# The receipts ship. The write up cites the ledger as the artefact the page and
# the paper share, and a reader who clones this and finds no ledger has been
# asked to take every number here on trust. The chains and the scenario sets go
# with it because they are what make a decision checkable rather than merely
# readable: scripts/replay.py re-prices a whole session out of them and reaches
# no network to do it.
#
# Still ignored, and for different reasons. The models directory, because no
# fitted model earned its way into the live path and an empty promise of one is
# worse than none. The logs, because 8.5MB of terminal escape codes and an
# nginx error page is not evidence of anything.
data/models/
*.log
.DS_Store
data/logs/

